        "description": {
          "en-US": "Paseo Assembly follows a pinned, reproducible fork-assembler stack based on\nupstream Paseo plus selected topic branches.\n\nThis channel is intended for development snapshots. It uses a distinct\nAndroid package ID, so it can be installed alongside the production Paseo\napp. F-Droid builds intentionally omit QR scanning, push notifications, and\nExpo over-the-air updates; direct and pasted-link pairing remain available."
